  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Lost Sailor &gt**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [6]\n- **Drums &gt**: rare: 3 archived performances [6]\n- **Space &gt**: rare: 3 archived performances [6]\n- **Sugar Magnolia &gt**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [6]\n- **Scarlet Begonias &gt**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [6]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **deadco2024-06-01.SteveMamaDD** (recommended): source not stated; 21 songs; 165 min; rated 2/5 by 1 [1]. Said about its sound: Reviewer says crowd talking drowns out the music on this recording, making it unlistenable [4]\n- **deadco2024-06-01.Arkayskis**: source not stated; 21 songs; 167 min [2]. Said about its sound: Reviewer finds the recording somewhat distant and low in level [5]\n- **deadco2024-06-01.Rick_Monture**: source not stated; 21 songs; 166 min [3]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Uploader did not know this source existed at the time; Rick Monture later came forward to get it circulated [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **deadco2024-06-01.SteveMamaDD**: taped by Steve K @ MamaDD; transferred by Hunter S; source: Phone [1]\n- **deadco2024-06-01.Arkayskis**: taped by Arkayskis; transferred by Arkayskis; source: Channel 1 & 2: Sony Compact lavaliere mic ECMLV1 > Tascam DR-05 [2]. Also: Reviewer suspects it duplicates the iPhone recording and is mislabeled; Sony ECMLV1 lavaliere mics into a Tascam DR-05, then SD to wav, Reaper, and 24-bit flac [2][5]\n- **deadco2024-06-01.Rick_Monture**: taped by Rick Monture; transferred by Hunter S; source: Source: Sony PCM A10 on board mics in the \"shotgun\" position 48/24 [3]",
